# Nova project configuration

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). `project.json` is authored; the schema,
module root and manifest are generated by NovaModuleTools.
Keep `Manifest.GUID` stable, the public definition matching it, and
`Manifest.PrivateData.Gerber` limited to the plugin marker, API version and
minimum host version. Do not add a duplicate GUID.

Keep coverage paths aligned with authored sources and validate configuration
with `Get-NovaProjectInfo`, `Invoke-NovaBuild` and both Nova test commands.
Review packaging settings before packaging. Versioning, release and publication
are separate authorized actions, not automatic completion steps.
